title: room.enter
---
<<music stop>>
<<if not $reachedStair>>
The stair turns once and ends at a door, with a thin line of light beneath it. #line:103-001
Watson: Holmes. Listen. #line:103-002
<<sound 133 wait>>
<<wait 0.6>>
<<sound 133 wait>>
<<wait 0.6>>
<<sound 133 wait>>
Somewhere below, a single clock is ticking. #line:103-003
Hero: Then someone down there is still keeping time. #line:103-004
<<set $reachedStair to true>>
<<wait 1.5>>
<<room 105>>
<<endif>>
===

title: room.look
---
Stone steps, worn hollow in the middle. Older than the shop above them. #line:103-005
===

title: light.look
---
Lamplight, under a door. Someone is awake down there. #line:103-006
===

title: light.do
---
Hero: Not yet, Watson. Let us hear what they say before they hear us. #line:103-007
===

title: watson.talk
---
Watson: I'll be right behind you. #line:103-008
===
